# The life is gained by the Inn's controller: each player who plays one gains 2. Bot1 plays its Inn on turn 1 and Bot2 its
# own on turn 2, so both end at 22 (Bot2's Inn does nothing for Bot1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Adventurer's Inn
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Adventurer's Inn
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
? Bot1.Life = 22
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 22
Stack.Count = 0
